  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation Health Program - Review health programme</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xE4;rdering h&#xE4;lsoprogram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka estniska h&#xE4;lsospecialisters kunskap om utv&#xE4;rdering avnationella h&#xE4;lsoprogram, liksom att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra lokal utyv&#xE4;rderingskompetens. Utv&#xE4;rderingen av &quot;National Health Programme for Children and Adolecents&quot; kommer att genomf&#xF6;ras av ett estniskt utv&#xE4;rderingsteam medst&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n svenska experter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The obejctive of the project is to increase awareness of public healthspecialists about evaluation of national health programmes, as well asimprove local evaluation skills. The evaluation of the &quot;National Health Programme for Children and Adolecents&quot; will be done by a local evaluation team with practical support from Swedish experts.</narrative>
  </description>
